get.description:
Fetches a single WARP device. Not supported when [multi-user mode](https://developers.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-one/connections/connect-devices/warp/deployment/mdm-deployment/windows-multiuser/) is enabled for the account.

**Deprecated**: please use one of the following endpoints instead:
- GET /accounts/{account_id}/devices/physical-devices/{device_id}
- GET /accounts/{account_id}/devices/registrations/{registration_id}

200.description:
Delete Objects response. Body shape depends on the operation mode:
- "delete by list" returns an array of `{ key }` entries for successfully deleted objects;
- "delete by prefix" returns the prefix-delete job descriptor.

